# {{ org_name }} — Export Control Pre-Project Screening Checklist

**EIN**: {{ ein }}

This checklist must be completed by the Principal Investigator (PI) before initiating any new research project, partnership, subaward, or material transfer. It determines whether U.S. export control regulations (EAR, ITAR, OFAC) apply and what level of institutional review is required.

