## Section 1: Fundamental Research Determination

| # | Question | Answer |
|---|----------|--------|
| 1.1 | Is this research intended for open publication without restriction? | [ ] Yes [ ] No |
| 1.2 | Will the sponsor/funder impose any access, dissemination, or publication restrictions? | [ ] Yes [ ] No |
| 1.3 | Will any portion involve classified or Controlled Unclassified Information (CUI) data? | [ ] Yes [ ] No |
| 1.4 | Will any portion involve proprietary data under NDA or other confidentiality agreement? | [ ] Yes [ ] No |

**Routing:**

- **If 1.1 = Yes AND 1.2 = No AND 1.3 = No AND 1.4 = No** → Fundamental Research Exclusion applies (NSDD-189 / 15 CFR 734.8). Skip to **Section 5**.
- **If any answer deviates from the above** → Proceed to **Section 2**.

