---

## Section 5: Determination

Based on the responses above, check the applicable determination:

- [ ] **Fundamental Research Exclusion applies** — No export control restrictions. No further action required.
- [ ] **No export controls identified** — Project does not involve controlled items, data, or restricted destinations/persons.
- [ ] **Export controls apply — Technology Control Plan (TCP) required** — PI must implement TCP before project work begins.
- [ ] **Export controls apply — License required** — Do not begin controlled activities until license is obtained from the relevant agency (BIS/DDTC/DOE).
- [ ] **Requires external ITAR counsel review** — Project involves USML items or defense services; outside counsel must review before execution.

